    "name": "The \"Wanna Be Sassy\" Creole Spice Blend",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Wanna Be Sassy is a mix of herbs and dehydrated ingredients that are popular in the Haitian cuisine. We add ginger and turmeric to the blend, two ingredients that were not as popular as the rest when I was growing up. Enjoy a little sprinkle on your toasts! Mix a couple of spoons in some olive oil to marinate anything you like!</span></p>",
